{
  "info": {
    "name": "School-Teacher Matching Platform",
    "description": "Complete API collection for the School-Teacher Matching Platform.\n\n## Quick Start\n1. Run `POST School / Register` → the `school_token` variable is set automatically.\n2. Run `POST Teacher / Register` → the `teacher_token` variable is set automatically.\n3. Run `POST Recommender / Refresh Matches` to generate match scores.\n4. Explore `GET School Matches` and `GET Teacher Matches`.\n\n## Variables\n| Variable | Auto-set by | Description |\n|---|---|---|\n| `base_url` | Manual | Server URL (default: http://127.0.0.1:8000) |\n| `school_token` | School Login / Register | Auth token for school requests |\n| `teacher_token` | Teacher Login / Register | Auth token for teacher requests |\n| `admin_token` | Admin Login | Auth token for admin-only requests |\n| `subject_need_id` | Create Subject Need | ID of last created subject need |\n| `teaching_subject_id` | Add Teaching Subject | ID of last created teaching subject |\n| `match_id` | School/Teacher Matches | ID of first match in latest list response |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_postman_id": "school-teacher-platform-v1"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Base URL of the Django development server"
    },
    {
      "key": "school_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Auth token for school user – auto-set on login/register"
    },
    {
      "key": "teacher_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Auth token for teacher user – auto-set on login/register"
    },
    {
      "key": "admin_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Auth token for admin user – set manually after admin login"
    },
    {
      "key": "subject_need_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "ID of a subject need – auto-set on Create Subject Need"
    },
    {
      "key": "teaching_subject_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "ID of a teaching subject – auto-set on Add Teaching Subject"
    },
    {
      "key": "match_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "ID of a match – auto-set on list responses"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🏫 Schools",
      "description": "School account management, profile, and subject needs.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register School",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('school_token', json.token);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('subject_need_id', json.school_id ? '1' : '1');",
                  "    pm.test('Registration successful', () => pm.expect(json).to.have.property('token'));",
                  "    pm.test('School name returned', () => pm.expect(json.school_name).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "} else {",
                  "    pm.test('Registration failed – check body', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(201));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"school_demo\",\n  \"password\": \"demopass123\",\n  \"email\": \"school@demo.com\",\n  \"name\": \"Demo High School\",\n  \"school_type\": \"mixed\",\n  \"education_level\": \"high\",\n  \"phone\": \"02100000001\",\n  \"district\": \"District 3\",\n  \"address\": \"10 Pasdaran St, Tehran\",\n  \"subject_needs\": [\n    {\n      \"subject_name\": \"Physics\",\n      \"education_level\": \"high\",\n      \"min_salary_per_hour\": 500000,\n      \"max_salary_per_hour\": 800000\n    },\n    {\n      \"subject_name\": \"Math\",\n      \"education_level\": \"high\",\n      \"min_salary_per_hour\": 450000,\n      \"max_salary_per_hour\": 750000\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/schools/register/",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "schools", "register", ""]
            },
            "description": "Create a new school account together with one or more subject needs.\n\nOn success (201) the `school_token` collection variable is set automatically."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login School",
          "event": [
